  "goodToKnow": "Der Absolvent (die Absolventin) is a graduate: Hochschulabsolventen (university graduates), Schulabsolventen. It's a weak noun: den Absolventen. Absolvieren means to complete: ein Studium, eine Ausbildung or ein Praktikum absolvieren. German universities traditionally had no graduation ceremony, but Absolventenfeiern with hats are becoming popular. From Latin absolvere (to finish). Plural: die Absolventen."
